[font=Verdana][size=4]
[b]Arena and countdown fixes[/b]

This update improves arena membership, inventory protection, PvP elimination and starting countdowns.

[list]
[*][b]Arena membership:[/b] Players can no longer join multiple arenas at the same time. Leave your current arena before joining another one.
[*][b]Inventory protection:[/b] Inventory dragging is now blocked while inside an arena.
[*][b]PvP elimination:[/b] Lethal hits from players, including player-fired projectiles, now eliminate the target into spectator mode instead of causing a normal Minecraft death.
[*][b]Starting countdowns:[/b] Zero-second starting countdowns now start the game at the configured player threshold. Filling an arena never extends a shorter countdown already in progress.
[*][b]Timer validation:[/b] Negative timer settings now produce a console warning and fall back to the corresponding defaults on startup and configuration reload.
[/list]

